          {
            "title": "Specifying Text Fonts",
            "id": 129162,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "CSS seçicilerini, **subheader** ve **about** bölümlerini uygun şekilde hedefleyecek biçimde tamamla.\n\n1. `.subheader` CSS sınıfının `20px`, `sans-serif` yazı tipi stilini ve `.about` CSS sınıfının `12px`, `sans-serif` yazı tipi stilini belirtmesi için CSS seçicilerini tamamla.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 1,
              "hasVisualOutput": true,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "index.html",
                  "codeLanguage": "html",
                  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <title>About Me</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h2>About Me!</h2>\n    <p class=\"subheader\">Currently studying Art History</p>\n    <p class=\"about\">I am a third year university student studying Art History.\n      I am particularly interested in Renaissance-era art. I will be completing\n      an internship with the Smithsonian institute this summer.</p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
                  "solvedContent": null
                },
                {
                  "name": "style.css",
                  "codeLanguage": "css",
                  "content": " {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-family: sans-serif;\n }\n\n  {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-family: sans-serif;\n }",
                  "solvedContent": ".subheader {\n font-size: 20px;\n font-family: sans-serif;\n}\n\n.about {\n font-size: 12px;\n font-family: sans-serif;\n}"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
